            "review_title": "Review at Bo Kho Tron",
            "review_text": "Julie Pham\n8 contributions\n0\nA Vietnamese traditional food you should eat in your lifetime\nJul 2020\nAnd of course you should try it at Bò Kho Tròn. Stew beef is tender, fragrant, well absorbed with spices, herbs mixed in the sauce. Served with a bit of basil, cilantro, and onions is deliciously spicy. The best beef stew is to be eaten with bread. You should tear the bread and dip it in the sauce. Awesome! Just like Heaven!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 11, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
